(LESSON 5  REAL-WORLD EXAMPLE) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Imagine a student club needs a launch asset with a deadline, a small budget, and mobile-first audiences. Ask clarifying questions, propose a version-one scope, share a checkpoint early, and request specific feedback.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(A professional result is not just attractive; it is usable, on time, accessible, easy to update, and connected to an outcome.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(LESSON 6  QUALITY AND RESPONSIBILITY) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Check accuracy, readability, permissions, privacy, accessibility, and whether the output works in its actual context. Credit sources and never present generated or copied work as your own.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Ask: can a beginner understand this? Can a person with a different device use it? Can the next teammate continue the work?) Tj
0 -18 Td
