(FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Q: What if my first version is poor? A: Treat it as a diagnostic draft; use feedback to choose the next experiment.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Q: Which tool should I learn first? A: Pick the tool that matches a real project and learn only the features that project needs.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Q: How do I know I am improving? A: Keep dated versions and compare decisions, not only the final appearance.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
